{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the clockwork chambers of <i>Geargrid</i>, where every match you make turns the cogs of a grand steampunk engine. This tile-matching puzzle adventure fuses vintage machinery aesthetics with addictive gameplay. Sort, stack, and solve intricate puzzles across handcrafted mechanical stages\u2014each one more challenging than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd29 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match 3 identical tiles to clear the grid and keep the gears turning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stunning steampunk visuals with brass, copper, and gear-laced detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increasing difficulty and layered puzzle design for true tacticians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fluid animations and polished UI in a vintage industrial theme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual yet deeply satisfying gameplay loop</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810000?t=1749853354","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810000?t=1749853354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810000/119c948b79861b652a1d64dc7e8896c16fbe48bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749853354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810000/119c948b79861b652a1d64dc7e8896c16fbe48bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749853354","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the clockwork chambers of <i>Geargrid</i>, where every match you make turns the cogs of a grand steampunk engine. This tile-matching puzzle adventure fuses vintage machinery aesthetics with addictive gameplay. Sort, stack, and solve intricate puzzles across handc